[!linux] skip 'uses the linux layer'

# link through a machine's life: what is in the way, --backup, a second
# layer, a file gone from the repo, a sealed secret. The parity scripts
# link-conflict and link-backup hold the TypeScript's words for the first
# two.

# Real files in the way are reported and left alone; link exits 0.
exec homebot link
cmp stdout conflict.stdout
! stderr .
exists home/.vim
grep 'a file where the repo has a folder' home/.vim

# --backup moves them aside, named with the clock, then links.
exec homebot link --backup
cmp stdout backup.stdout
! stderr .
grep 'a file where the repo has a folder' home/.vim.homebot-backup-20260101-000000
exists home/.tmux.homebot-backup-20260101-000000/keep

# A second layer unfolds a folded folder; a file gone from the repo is
# pruned; a sealed secret is locked.
mkdir home/.home/autolink/linux/vim
cp extra home/.home/autolink/linux/vim/extra
rm home/.home/autolink/common/tmux
mkdir home/.home/private/common
cp sealed home/.home/private/common/token.age
exec homebot link --dry-run
cmp stdout dry.stdout
exec homebot link
cmp stdout grow.stdout
! exists home/.tmux

-- home/.home/homebot.yml --
profiles:
  default: workstation
-- home/.home/autolink/common/zshrc --
export REPO=1
-- home/.home/autolink/common/gitconfig --
[user]
-- home/.home/autolink/common/tmux --
tmux
-- home/.home/autolink/common/vim/vimrc --
set nu
-- home/.zshrc --
export MINE=1
-- home/.gitconfig --
[user]
-- home/.tmux/keep --
a folder where the repo has a file
-- home/.vim --
a file where the repo has a folder
-- extra --
extra
-- sealed --
age
-- conflict.stdout --
  adopt   ~/.gitconfig
  blocked ~/.tmux  is a folder, but the repo has a file here
  blocked ~/.vim  is a file, but the repo has a folder here
  blocked ~/.zshrc  already exists with different content
1 change, 0 already linked, 3 blocked
To move what is in the way aside (renamed *.homebot-backup-<time>, nothing is deleted):
  homebot link --backup
-- backup.stdout --
moved aside ~/.tmux.homebot-backup-20260101-000000
moved aside ~/.vim.homebot-backup-20260101-000000
moved aside ~/.zshrc.homebot-backup-20260101-000000
Compare and delete them when you have a minute:
  homebot cleanup
  link    ~/.tmux
  link    ~/.vim
  link    ~/.zshrc
3 changes, 1 already linked
-- dry.stdout --
  unfold  ~/.vim
  link    ~/.vim/extra
  link    ~/.vim/vimrc
  locked  ~/.token
  remove  ~/.tmux
2 already linked
-- grow.stdout --
  unfold  ~/.vim
  link    ~/.vim/extra
  link    ~/.vim/vimrc
  remove  ~/.tmux
4 changes, 2 already linked, 1 locked (homebot unlock)
